code_sketch:
ButtonGroup group = new ButtonGroup();          // parent: one owner
JRadioButton a = new JRadioButton("A");
JRadioButton b = new JRadioButton("B");
group.add(a); group.add(b);                      // children declare membership
a.addActionListener(e -> model.setSelected("A")); // or one listener on the group

